- state estimates and key effects meet prespecified precision targets; and
- confirmatory predictive performance stabilizes within a predefined tolerance.

Do not stop early for favorable point estimates. Permit early termination only for equipment damage, unsafe operation, invalid measurement performance, or a protocol failure that makes causal contrasts uninterpretable.

If no candidate explanation satisfies the confirmation criteria, conclude that the tested measurable factors do not adequately explain the persistent differences; report bounds on remaining effects and use residual state patterns to specify the next study rather than declaring equivalence.

## 8. Limitations

- Latent states may be only weakly identifiable when multiple mechanisms produce similar temperature, density, or strength signatures.
- Sensor proxies may not measure local bead-interface conditions directly.
- Destructive tensile testing prevents repeated measurement of the same coupon.
- Some structural measurements, such as CT or microscopy, may be feasible only on a subset and may introduce selection issues.
- Perturbations around the nominal recipe may not reproduce naturally occurring faults or long-term degradation.
- Carryover after drying, maintenance, nozzle replacement, or thermal interventions may violate simple Markov assumptions.
- Printer, material, geometry, color/additive package, slicer, and environmental specificity may limit generalization.
- A well-fitting dynamic model does not by itself establish causality; randomized interventions and crossover evidence remain essential.
- Strength normalization using measured dimensions can either remove geometric artifacts or obscure extrusion-related mechanisms, so both force and normalized outcomes should be retained.
- Rare defects may require more builds than indicated by variance-based power calculations.
- Unmeasured conditioning, handling, or machine-control variables may remain in the residual state.
- The study can bound unexplained variation but cannot prove that every possible mechanism has been considered.
